<!-- R10.8-gear-sheet: the header gear (button 3735) opens this modal window (id 1170). Design option A of staged/gear-panel-redesign:
     a right-side sheet "Settings" with three groups (Home / Accounts / System), one help line per row, the white focus pill of the
     audio / subtitle cards (av-pill-480.png, live since R8.1). Replaces R10.6 / R10.6.1's tile + list (the include Netflix_Options_Tiles / Netflix_Options_Items in
     Dialog_DialogView.xml is now unused by 1170 and left alone; window 1171 and the stock DialogView still use that file).
     R10.10 Customize Home: the home-on variant. Row 7001 (Customize Home, opens window 1179) is always visible and takes focus first;
     the skin string Netflix.CustomizeHome.Ready is no longer read anywhere.
     Rows (ids): 7001 Customize Home,
     7002 Real-Debrid, 7003 Ratings &amp; Artwork, 7004 MDbList Key, 7005 Advanced Settings. Up / Down move to the nearest visible row and wrap;
     Left and Back close (PreviousMenu, focus returns to the gear); Right does nothing. Every action is the one the previous panel ran.
     The add-on rows keep their old visible conditions (POV / TMDb Helper enabled). Nothing here runs until a row is clicked. -->
